{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 24, :comments ["<b>This is what pertains to the Levites.</b> The meaning is: this is the appointed measure, and 'from thirty years old' does not contradict this verse, for 'from thirty years old' is for the labor of carrying, and 'from twenty-five' for the service of the Tent." "And the meaning of <b>to serve</b> [לצבא]: to be counted among the host of those who serve."], :book :numbers, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:16:52.538139724Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}